---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// NOTE: community chat / social links are intentionally absent until the
// canonical invites are confirmed. Add them to the cards below when ready.
---

<Base
  title="Community — Peace Antz"
  description="Ways to take part in Peace Antz today: create and share quote cards, start a conversation, offer your skills, or simply follow along."
>
  <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top: 2.5rem">
    <div class="container center">
      <span class="kicker">Join in</span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.9rem)">Community</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline: auto">
        Peace Antz is at the beginning of a new chapter, and the honest truth
        is that the colony is small. That makes early friends matter more, not
        less. Here’s what taking part looks like right now.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="pill pill--live">Today</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0.8rem">Create &amp; give</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
          The simplest act of participation: make a
          <a href="/create">quote card</a>, print a few, and leave them where
          someone might need one — a library book, a café table, a friend’s
          desk. Quiet outreach, one kind word at a time.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="pill pill--live">Today</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0.8rem">Start a conversation</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
          Questions, encouragement, ideas, disagreements — all welcome.
          <a href="/contact">Write to us</a> and you’ll get a real reply from a
          real person. If you made cards and gave them away, tell us how it
          landed; those stories shape what we build next.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="pill pill--live">Today</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0.8rem">Offer a skill</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
          Teacher, musician, maker, translator, developer, organizer — if the
          <a href="/principles">principles</a> resonate and you want to build
          something aligned with them, <a href="/contact">introduce yourself</a>.
          Collaboration starts with consultation.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="pill pill--future">Soon</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0.8rem">Gather</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
          A shared community space (chat, study circles, jam sessions) is part
          of the <a href="/vision">roadmap</a>. We’re choosing the venue
          carefully rather than pointing you at an empty room — links will
          appear here when there’s a fire to gather around.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section band--dark">
    <div class="container center reveal">
      <h2>The colony grows one ant at a time</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline: auto">
        However you found this place — welcome. Small contributions, valued
        highly, is literally written into our history.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--gold" href="/contact" style="margin-top: 1rem">Say hello</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
